    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fe869c6f63f9c5ddedae5b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于热闹的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 中漂亮地摘下了重大胜利的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fef315d6a0a75cf8121a34d412a3f8fa5fcb3bd2968e4d4d325e7ad9b735372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a3be39a21fa5e72db242c5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "389b237302d16d57b802e16d8afb78d2af726ebbff5eee0acd499ea106f05a54",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4c44bbec74e64efa3fae898",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，漂亮地在重要战役中抢下了胜利的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c7f1b244792a7d17161348fc25c5a5023a1ce8a91b4f382ec4d3f4e1d63587c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ef3a146c234360fa5c838f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让我们期待她在本次获胜之后，更加精彩的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0cb2fb6c0a9c17c4dbd5d76af4c9d0792a5236a2a8b6cff415c60a391c2440",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "2201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee857b9eb66569e65f5673a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很期待该名赛马娘究竟能攀登至哪里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77cb54630025d5863223e96c36e41407456dd701508e08493eda885b90a3b8dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "2202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554a41b45d6c0253a6aba5dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她发挥擅长一决胜负的实力，在粉丝间的支持度也逐渐攀升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "459aebd292c29b12a8c3b45fb7b50a254e68b6ee1cbff23b2c5d353329aecabb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6967b6788ffc1f15f8620c93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然她在本次大赛中的出场次数还不多，但已具备大人物的气势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b4a874db39656871dfe881db3bad491ecc868f96dfa0c389952a760c4554bbd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0988c95b081bf4c0d0a52e25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使面对盛大舞台也能不退缩地发挥实力，足以证明其为强者。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62b683ee035e3f26e261e453a60bb53cff43f4c5f19e1990f0e33c9fbc945fe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a730ebc106e6fc58b2df59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让我们继续期待这名赛马娘今后的精彩表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1724a4f25819e932cc177ffff6f50ce608d67bc60f2579519774289f267349e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17a04903f66a973c7af6ad1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让我们期待她在本次获胜之后，更加精彩的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0cb2fb6c0a9c17c4dbd5d76af4c9d0792a5236a2a8b6cff415c60a391c2440",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:555838565c8f4abc3edea9a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很期待该名赛马娘究竟能攀登至哪里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77cb54630025d5863223e96c36e41407456dd701508e08493eda885b90a3b8dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "22202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f93d6464a4e294862598a2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，至今未尝败绩的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2902261a3ea428373ae479b4c077aca621654bb99daab6dc3869ed6f2bd629",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d311e6961646c11bef23ae3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不知败北为何物的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度于<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中拿下胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d9b5ca6c16030cc57c4fa3b014bbaba4e79d0a251e520fdfdbc6c9d22463d26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2a6595d253fa98f05dc645",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 的赛况难以预料，但依旧不动摇属于<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>的胜利。她再度拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1b1779cfaec98e3f587d5800793ee1423e608bcba6ab928ccd1103bce2c45e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcb3aeeb9cb27c3ba170c0ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她的精彩表现让我们在本次大赛中，很快就听见优胜候补的呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c3d7a604e738c32e379e8a03c8813a8e838fdf87e48fa86926a625d99b5236",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29db6b2e20b32dcad5d5e3fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽说她本次的参赛经验尚不丰富，但确实拥有在关键时刻取胜的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fffc72fcee71ae681061d59ef97773ebde04bf76d9b98f9b4f596f8f5e5dac6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85a8eb75ba1f578a06195870",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使受到周遭提防，她还是以精彩的表现上演了连胜剧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87dcc25d4ce56776773be4c539dbe72c30339df159e0ff1a89190f470e90a053",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc300840315a96342c942347",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她能够过关斩将直到何时呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cddb276b79959e8081523bcce08752ff336e65d5a9a30c537495eb9f8c1b77ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff2c8f6a2cba31dca7f9c2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她能继续获胜到何时呢？其今后的表现也让人无比期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb524491486b3e4449dd2ae83053ec4c7ee1e5da2c6fd644913315e63f78c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7245f0fdb5ce4a4e8da8abb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可别错过她在本次大赛之后的表现……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a1b35c2829026cc5ee47ce368849f75e3ce8f25d6b05feb434a69bdcd68932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "27202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69bb85c8fbb0c5621437022",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这名赛马娘的第2战也绝不容错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c99bbb682f3641f10a9b4357137bf56e75c3b2b26220c3f1f2696a2813f18ac3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95441060da3e38346d51e53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在波涛汹涌的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 上，为<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>带来胜利的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65974ea55c763b15dbd43eafd03c8f512a3cdb770974175108252d572687808b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b83c8eca13b00001e249cc16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在这场极具意义的重要竞赛中获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49fb66b4ac8a74a9f1f1becbfd4660724da7cb525249f16f41ddefc24a1795bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8dd2f9e2c4106a4ef60f023",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在强者聚集的这一战中获得第1的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a582483d409a52c30112bd261c6f316879f0725f95eb997990e0fb2f7d530c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bfc06d8fb511e07725a181",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "非常期待她今后的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "952c24cb31697a81e9d9bd90ffc7b4c154aaa26b470ba56a8bf2f12b55163e9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70dc68f47870f7e14ada14ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她克服至今的逆境，展现出了相当精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6686b91531df09ea5d47d091a797ee55638d57a4c182c25fa47f2101231fcd34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e58c7f5b5b1876557438ac7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她一扫最近的不佳状态，以完美的表现称霸了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d645d0d539e7671dbc1ff5188f86f8941031020d21617e0a7132a87808b7419",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340305dde03420bdc86a9be6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于在最佳时机夺下了梦寐以求的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a6f32ade34ef127ee5d09d43dc9a082c787c66aa220cfe16afdcf6b703621c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f2e70d906b9b64cd4406964",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>漂亮地称霸了战况激烈的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70111cf33528bb8e3435b2c9929fbbb2dc1eee1700fbc877be42a1907078aa5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44da07839b76dbf90bddb6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "近期的不佳状态宛如从来不存在似地，以<bashin>压制对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a95a468f1e8d4bf0a09d648beb6152de287d777c900e7a9ca81606d312eb9568",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0e5a827683775699bc7acf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6978301f418f1dc04167b6bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa31350af4339dced7229551",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0584fc01cba71dd9d55484",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08f6da65f4e1e5cab443807",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "值得将她视为大赛中需瞩目的赛马娘来持续关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e21076abefe3dc59a1509d0f764e709a7c025ea8fcc18aaa04fed4e1ab320ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38917ad1b914dfed8d7b2f57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然展现了这样的表现，之后应该也十分令人期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79511ea7b1e46ceca29481f273da9eab36e6f415f3984ca24afac64364cb4521",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24449f1f5372778a00aadd55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好，非常期待今后的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fbab5d144f6330e4d7a02dd38d05b40411b6fcae62c063199914c70d67fee6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c529f334663d12f4fa440d4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "状态转好，可以期待接下来一路过关斩将吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7ad71681cba8405786616bf3df5c581e61978574e259f398d9e478d7b5c0fb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "30202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6fc0a87ce517c3421606b8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "极度欢腾的第2轮。<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d62b6c0555a69879cfc73ae28ef2fc250469a87d006c2e800c5d5984bcb6cf4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d2ad1e79f26026cb9962e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>以<bashin>称霸了竞赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f5b0aa3715fd7d2636a0c5fbb25d9e5135c961fe7001c7c0d2411745414002",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ef7354c9587e9e8c5eaf695",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在菁英齐聚的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>以<bashin>获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01ae0469f3054a13df6be33b69f06e804e80aa62a04cdd7e86cc3bf7680dd1eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243c691bf515edf26f99a421",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然前阵子有输有赢，但这次展露出精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bb479da7711702e8c93c176c795371332d003651759151dddc3ab9616713393",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61f8faa093de87647ef6326d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然当这名赛马娘进入她擅长的状况后，就能战线压倒性的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fe74cbd87657a863b3995bb1fe0d63dbed12c44884ebd0873259a239290f8f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9277d86dda89ce1a05fd6f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那发自内心享受竞赛的态度和跑法，为其带来良好的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7beb0f047732cf20968ff7a24d335f0849c2d4e2320d7522116dd2da0bdf822e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6893841ee4ea37032f95e248",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完美贯彻身为『王牌』的职责，实在了不起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01ccf6c02138dadc2d230207cbb1b62aae596c7e56694d9c6be29299455a853",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ed9881a002a8ef9efa2af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a1be8e8ff429363f0d074e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff2a928cca9a1837b84c6ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1801dbbe5ef19af4b4af38",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:999a00306a9f14771cf98a65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该有很多观众会成为她的新粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49a8b27dfa607379dc3e6332efb2cb6df6a2d0138e6acdc82e5255d20cdc54cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f104f59f4097f2345854edd7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沐浴在聚光灯下的她，表现能更上一层楼吗……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2bcf5706fc364b49190597b790acca71c6b603db8ae2f1627271cf7d6b9b341",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f1fc3785ca8aa7993cce95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想必她在下次的竞赛也会以精彩的表现让我们为之狂热吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4856596391c19da8a9e8099e593deba0043ba4671e4869c8b81920385288b0e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "31202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd193f5aeb62530612138b10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在重要的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 一战中获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49191235593facbb36e0a6c8fcee7b8e2486d52e3d08164590c5b8eb78bd51d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ea73f13c31c20d2c2df48d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在欢欣鼓舞的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中，由<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>拿下第1！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e32eacae674a03ad805b8c4f093315d251e40e5cc2f8eae7fff3c6b2ee4b4b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217120aefa68af89bec9df0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在大批观众注目下获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a745f3887d864aebbd193e5bb7b7c2a2169bdc270656bbaba9670e749c0b163c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f7007f99a33af7244a03342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以近期5战2胜的战绩获得注目的赛马娘果然实力坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19f2fe9a1de71570090ce8660dd2ab9485c6c8c41cf7466e91592e79b4083f9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49692ae3a24bbfced9101abf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她不愧深具实力，即使与强敌并列也能有出类拔萃的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66935e8d4d0f29f9d2ac0f823dc84defae2bed4cf670baaf64dbe2fc7d6bafd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63fec6396e6a7da1e8c3fca0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她展现了不论对手是谁、不论战场在何处都能发挥实力的稳定性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6434271ef7d1bfc6a838a2c7e995ec115b7881cde7a3e59e607c57968de6bcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79fbd7eb193e5deb20a3e8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够彻底在<bashin>的交战中胜出的实力无须质疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ea88a7bfd997a96c49b66dddc8d6d1c585691267a9debe1e066cafd579d568f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b641a1cb45899c104463f092",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她在参赛者净是强豪的竞赛中，竟然以<bashin>胜出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b940cb9503cb3e58f66ada4a317e1ce317249c100a389e7d5aa064f2fab95230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e4c6baad891a724c5de2c34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "作为<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的王牌漂亮地打赢了一场硬仗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89a68c044d528d572038f01a5df347ab086e9912fcdaea14f2ed039868026f8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0bd668ea7708f942fa4d6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的领头之姿，从头到尾称霸竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3a94b6407f63bbfe4db511b1ad8c9523b7652557609df960588c7ed1236f7f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3110b7ad86601161854b3077",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于前列以稳健的表现顺利地击败了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6813197caedf1ab36fb6fa4ad98f2eecefd47f4f5f2e41217898ee282f3bf29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ce93206bce8c19253c0626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充分发挥速度，以精彩的居中支配了竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e160aa9cc09562fe9f1aacd9edd1ced625d25884c6e63e17f4e6786bf9a0820",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3f4db2b3b98a64a1ed0f25",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以漂亮的后追，一个一个地超越了对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e42e39105bf0d3ed3e523007703e09fe05d02600291575d2f943a40d039741",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe918ea8746f712146069515",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望还能够持续看到如此精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caca7ce435219560096ccc9eba9ad08ed71e68ea3d673fa1076290f4882cd4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2288745a658c41af19e5acc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "究竟能攀登至那里呢？让人无法移开视线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa46217a07ba803ba7c416628895157c1f849d9e3f93fed7c60b2d505b4a9780",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbda4f69f7e468d7a1b7ffe8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可不要错过这名赛马娘和大家约定好要获得的成功……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7968d0bc066587e16d4b103a8e2e64464ac2c368a72a351ed36b0b8628c1d140",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "32202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26310d01dd8a917c597f677d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "座无虚席的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛！<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>漂亮地摘下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93b0b0071b154f111adea3379842f6902a7615a7f25a6c8b570a8de155d34ab1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52132263e408fed1f88291b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，逼退众多强者们取胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69e76fd060913520c22e20983802c5011517fc8fd71d49c70a1644ae14dab9ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92f45f1ab3f58f3f98c22a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！在高手云集的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮竞赛中顺利拿下第1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bb3513f9e2f4386063faa01b4369f8f079f7e3db38d4b9243e5f3f15fb523b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e017bd0c8764e05e6f1394d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战3胜的状态还不错，照这个气势下去也能称霸这场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1320b0349e87523e009bef5db8e9c296940bc8d1ed29a8f00ee53aade11dbb2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bf39b745213633198c27981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在本次大赛一帆风顺地一路胜出的赛马娘，让这场竞赛也十分精彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7188321109904a0eea7113fcc12ebc32d60e044cb176ce14ee8c63358def2073",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5239c41a21c4a5944d70ace",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便解说也只能想到赞美的话语，以完美表现拿下的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6ec596782905c1424b38b1732ca77ce69fe304c2b44631d211c91b5db56db46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ead81c7c95465d895c7eda1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现出了让人一看就明白为何会有如此高胜率的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e35614cfc343ebf5eb3c066acbadbf8919f1cbe29544f520f3208663d8300c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d895594d8aae74eec28ffcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>激烈地交战到现在，胜利已是垂手可得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b1d0bcfe763c861dfccd15061b7f9b9395413027342a38509a49a74b4d22bf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143a8fc461dd4dec99f3773c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以<bashin>跑出无法想象她会输的完美胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bc6a6f94f5a8056541ba13ddc50a83ca50d7a9b522d313d944a412dbf0566cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9115463feb731082216392",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的评价也扶摇直上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "843be21c5d61e9058ae85bbfe7f6d40dc0c736e2763f0d2d2f039dd23055bec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb35e5433f5ea0985e162cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经备受瞩目的她，究竟还会站上多高的地方呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed37972978e674b5b94b98fa43ecd1d9643e51e4efcd5b5c78becb93bd5a9ce8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "33201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96e88f529088681b08eadd5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让人现在就开始期待她之后的参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8898c4689fe67a8d6347549858906341519ab6acbbd8e0846c3bb43e1138346a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
